{"title":"Wednesday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/922079495/0/marginalrevolution~Wednesday-assorted-links.html","date":1753286184000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2025/07/21/us-states-step-up-to-fund-the-arts-in-the-wake-of-federal-cuts?utm_source=The+Art+Newspaper+Newsletters&amp;utm_campaign=531a4c40a0-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2025_06_07_02_41_COPY_01&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_-736e5667b3-62240358\" target=\"_blank\">State-level arts funding is to some extent substituting for federal arts funding</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/karlmehta/status/1947284189461782807\" target=\"_blank\">Norwegian sovereign wealth fund deploys AI</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/aryopg/status/1947591901886222570\" target=\"_blank\">more thinking is not always good for the AI</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/ComteWasRight/status/1947771903302639826\" target=\"_blank\">Some Amish settlements have TFR above 10</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/MoreBirths/status/1947733910177075582\" target=\"_blank\">Colombia is now at 1.2</a>.  And<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sanilac_j/status/1947891572366053812?s=46\" target=\"_blank\"> coupling rate vs. fertility rate</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/music/2025/07/22/vanessa-opera-williamstown-theatre-festival/\" target=\"_blank\">Deep in the Berkshires, just off the Mohawk Trail, in an abandoned strip mall anchored by an erstwhile Price Chopper, awaits a sleek, smart production of Samuel Barber’s “Vanessa” that’s worth well more than the tank of gas it may require to get there.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bbc.com/travel/article/20250702-a-journey-through-the-united-states-of-barbecue\" target=\"_blank\">BBC list of America’s best barbecue</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/3756cd64-529e-4890-9e4f-aff4a46bb1a9\" target=\"_blank\">Coca-Cola has said it will launch a new version of its signature soft drink sweetened with cane sugar later this year, days after US President Donald Trump announced that the company had agreed to the move.</a>” (FT)</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/18tAUQV5GmWx25ycnsAzBHffaeqyEFrB-fSQvbs4yhHM/edit?slide=id.g3632901fc5e_0_167#slide=id.g3632901fc5e_0_167\" target=\"_blank\">Will LLMs make interviewing a much more powerful method?</a></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/wednesday-assorted-links-512.html\">Wednesday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/922079495/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/922079495/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/922079495/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/922079495/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/922079495/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email